(property "Design Notes" "RF matching is inside the SiP; RN_ESP_RF = antenna tuning pi only | SiP3.0..3.6V; integrated local decoupling; external bulk C_ESP_BULK | RC delay: R_CHIP_PU to 3V3_SYS + C_CHIP_PU to GND (values per Espressif HW design guidelines) | STRAP_BOOT | STRAP_JTAG_EFUSE_GATED | REV_D_REMAP (was PDM_CLK) | active-low falling-edge IRQ | N8R2:28PSRAM internal; unused GPIO38..42 board NC; N8R8 also internally reservesGPIO33..37 | Internal memory supply output; decouple, do not short to3V3_SYS; strapGPIO45=0 at reset | REV_D_REMAP (was I2S1_BCLK); U0TXD ROM log harmless into nRF SDIN | REV_D_REMAP (was I2S1_LRCLK); U0RXD is input at reset | STRAP_VDD_SPI; REV_D_REMAP (was I2S1_DOUT): only ESP32 drives it | STRAP_BOOT_PRINT" (at 76.2 43.18 0) (effects (font (size 0.9 0.9)) (hide yes)))
